Types & truth
-------------

  False: None, 0, 0.0, '', [], {}, set()
  True:  everything else
  Strings: '...' "..." """..."""  r'...'  u'...'
  Division: / vs // ; use from __future__ import division for 3.x-like /


Exceptions (common)
-------------------

  try:
      ...
  except Exception, e:      # classic 2.x
      ...
  finally:
      ...

  raise ValueError('msg')


